406349,"name":"Gabriel Werner","role":"A Character from the Hotel"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"L'anno scorso a Marienbad","overview":"Tentata dalla corte incessante di uno sconosciuto, che sostiene di averla già incontrata un'altra volta, una donna è contesa fra la possibilità di una evasione sentimentale e la precarietà del rapporto con il suo attuale compagno, che non ne avverte i turbamenti. Lei sembra lasciarsi persuadere dallo sconosciuto, ma la partita rimane aperta...."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Last Year at Marienbad","overview":"At a weekend gathering, a man tells a woman that they had spent time there together a year prior. But, the woman has no recollection whatsoever and is convinced that he is simply fabricating the encounter. The more he speaks about their activities the previous year however, the more compelling he becomes. The question remains however – did they meet previously or not?","tagline":"Extraordinary! Hypnotic! Beautiful! Masterful!"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Dans un château de Bohême transformé en hôtel, des gens vivent dans une atmosphère feutrée. Ils sont là pour se reposer, et tout autre bruit hors quelques paroles chuchotées est proscrit. Un homme s’attache à une femme et tente de la persuader qu’ils ont eu une aventure, l’année dernière à Marienbad."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/31M9IWDoliJ9ejTKgjr5hPQXOrD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h1ov8VcVCiZsnWRu4EjZ74R33GP.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":4024,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/31M9IWDoliJ9ejTKgjr5hPQXOrD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/31M9IWDoliJ9ejTKgjr5hPQXOrD.jpg","language":"it","width